BT 1 0 0 1 0 16.8 Tm /F1 9.2 Tf 13 TL (This document consolidates the working H framework and the first reported neural-network experiment. It) Tj T* (distinguishes conceptual definitions, empirical observations, and claims that remain unverified.) Tj T* ET
