1 0 0 1 57.02362 378.1307 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.4 Tm 13.2 TL /F2 9.2 Tf 0 0 0 rg (H) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( is a proposed master framework for investigating behaviour by identifying an abstract difference \(AD\), then) Tj T* (recursively investigating the structure of that difference. The framework is intended to help select mathematical) Tj T* (structures appropriate to the object being studied, rather than assume one fixed formula works for every input type.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 332.5307 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.4 Tm 13.2 TL /F1 9.2 Tf 0 0 0 rg (An ) Tj /F2 9.2 Tf (AD) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( is a mathematical structural representation or transformation that captures a particular level of behaviour. An) Tj T* (AD is not restricted to being a closed-form equation. A realization may be a mathematical concept, operation,) Tj T* (transformation, formula, function, or a combination/framework drawn from one or more mathematical fields.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 300.1307 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 17.2 Tm 13.2 TL /F1 9.2 Tf 0 0 0 rg (The ) Tj /F2 9.2 Tf (meaning) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( of an AD is its structural level in the hierarchy. Its ) Tj /F2 9.2 Tf (realization) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( is the mathematical object or method used) Tj T* (to investigate that level.) Tj T* ET
Q
