BT 1 0 0 1 0 17.2 Tm 13.2 TL /F2 9.2 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Object-sensitive:) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( the mathematical approach should depend on what the inputs and system actually are. Numbers,) Tj T* (sequences, functions, parameter states, and other mathematical objects may require different representations.) Tj T* ET
