BT 1 0 0 1 0 17.2 Tm 13.2 TL /F2 9.2 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Structure before formula:) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( identify what behaviour needs to be represented before selecting a particular formula or) Tj T* (operation.) Tj T* ET
