BT 1 0 0 1 0 17.2 Tm -0.123953 Tw 13.2 TL /F2 9.2 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Recursive investigation:) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( once a level of structure is represented, investigate how that structure itself behaves. Do not) Tj T* 0 Tw (stop at a descriptive label if a deeper structural question remains.) Tj T* ET
