BT 1 0 0 1 0 17.2 Tm 13.2 TL /F2 9.2 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Mathematical flexibility:) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( an AD can combine tools from several areas of mathematics when one isolated concept is) Tj T* (insufficient.) Tj T* ET
